sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Delivery as Delivery
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Delivery: cancel(reason)
    Note over Delivery: Policies: deliveryRead, deliveryWrite, deliveryExecute
    Note over Delivery: Guards (3)
    Delivery->>Delivery: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;scheduled#quot; or self.status == #quot;in_transit#quot;
    Delivery->>Delivery: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Delivery->>Delivery: guard[2]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;logisticsManageAccess#quot;)
    Delivery->>Delivery: compute.previousStatus
    Delivery->>Delivery: mutate.status
    Delivery->>Delivery: mutate.cancelledAt
    Delivery->>Delivery: mutate.cancellationReason
    Delivery->>EventBus: emit DeliveryCancelled on delivery.cancelled
    Delivery-->>-Client: void